WEBVTT

00:00:00.200 --> 00:00:05.025
Prepositions connect words to show relationships of position, direction, time,

00:00:05.025 --> 00:00:06.472
purpose and comparison.

00:00:07.283 --> 00:00:11.593
Which preposition shows movement in “Walk blank the gate”? Answer: towards

00:00:12.450 --> 00:00:16.674
Edit five sentences where prepositions are missing or used incorrectly.

00:00:17.533 --> 00:00:19.923
Discuss why: Towards shows direction.
